# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Twilio SMS Verification (Configured in Supabase Dashboard)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase natively handles Twilio SMS OTP verification via `supabase.auth.signInWithOtp`.
# To enable Twilio in your Supabase project:
# 1. Open Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> Providers -> Phone
# 2. Toggle "Enable Phone Provider" -> ON
# 3. Select SMS Provider: "Twilio"
# 4. Fill in your Twilio credentials:
#    - Twilio Account SID (e.g. ACxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx)
#    - Twilio Auth Token (e.g. your_auth_token_here)
#    - Twilio Message Service SID (e.g. MGxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx) OR Twilio Phone Number
# 5. Save settings. Phone verification will automatically route SMS OTPs via Twilio!
#
# See TWILIO_SUPABASE_SETUP.md for full step-by-step instructions.

